ow have in  place  is uh going to be key to helping us  continue that  priority in that journey all right so as  you heard from ron  this pattern provides many important  benefits over traditional architecture  so the first one is a global consistency  so cloud spanner has the benefit of true  time so it  easily lets you add a globally  consistent timestamp for each of your  events  so this establishes a ground truth of  the order for all of your messages at  all time  and you can have your downstream systems  work with that assumption  which is a huge benefit and solves a lot  of complexity for those downstream  systems  the next one is high availability  so multi-region rights are necessary for  systems that run in multiple places  east or west you know disaster recovery  but multi-region  rights are also great for sending events  from a single system in the data center  to multiple systems that run in the  stores  in this example or vice versa so for  things like price  inventory tracking real-time sales  metrics  this is uh important to have high  availability across the board  and as you mentioned earlier we've  actually tested this solution  for millions and millions of products  across channel  and the solution holds pretty well so if  you have some  very stringent slas and you want to make  sure that the performance doesn't  degrade when you're using millions of  millions of record then  this solution is probably the right one  for you and then as ron mentioned  earlier as well  is um this lets you focus  on these strategic tasks and the dev  teams  are focused on building business logic  or the business value directly  associated with the use case  and not worry about some of the  operational tasks of keeping the servers  up scaling them up or down because the  system takes care of that  this results in quicker time to market  and much lower total cost of ownership  for the solution  i want to again thank ron baker vice  president of merchandising technology at  lowe's companies  for sharing the information and his  thoughts with us  and to you uh thank you for listening to  our presentation  hope you found the content useful i just  want to say  add to that vikas uh you know thanks for  the partnership here with  google and you know really appreciate  the opportunity to speak  to what we've been able to accomplish  here in the pricing area you know like i  mentioned  uh an introduction you know lowe's  advancing our business  with technology like never before and  i'm excited to see  so many capabilities like pricing you  know enabled and proud of what our teams  have been able to accomplish  with this modern technology so i hope  all of you  as well got some valuable insights into  the content  and i want to thank all of you for your  time today
 

